course: dictionary
lesson: 12382
title: Culinary: all about cooking
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Culinary is an adjective, a describing word, and it means to do with cooking or the kitchen. When you see it, ask: is this about food being cooked?
explain: «The chef picked fresh culinary herbs from the garden.» The chef is cooking, and herbs are used to flavour food, so culinary herbs are the herbs you cook with. The sentence gives you the clue.
explain: Culinary can sound a little grand. «The village fair had a culinary delight: warm apple pie.» A culinary delight is a tasty food treat. Use culinary when you want to sound more formal than just saying cooking or food.
fact: Culinary means to do with cooking or the kitchen.
fact: In a more formal sense, culinary means connected with cooking as a skill or art, such as «culinary skills».
fact: «Culinary herbs» are herbs used in cooking, such as basil and mint.
fact: «A culinary delight» means a tasty food treat.
fact: Culinary is an adjective, so it describes a noun, like skills, herbs or school.
exercise: «The chef picked fresh culinary herbs from the garden.» What does culinary mean here? | Sharp and hard to chew | *To do with cooking | Very old and dusty | Growing wild in the woods
exercise: Which word in «She signed up for a culinary course to learn cooking skills.» means to do with cooking? | *culinary | course | signed | learn
exercise: Dad says the cake was «a culinary delight». What does he mean? | It was a delight to look at, but he did not eat it | It was cold and hard | *It was a tasty treat made with real cooking skill | It was a cake made of stone
test: «Culinary skills» are skills for which activity? | *Cooking | Growing trees | Driving a car | Reading maps
test: Which phrase is about cooking as a skill or art? | *a culinary school | a school bus | a school of fish | a noisy school
exam: Which sentence uses culinary correctly? | The culinary dog ran across the field | *The culinary herbs gave the soup a lovely flavour | The bus was culinary and fast | Culinary the sky was blue today
